# DeepSeek r1 -- third-party data and large generated instances are NOT vendored.
#
# This round explicitly follows the "URL + SHA-256 + fetch instructions instead of
# vendored raw data" rule for anything large or third-party. See
# ../../DEEPSEEK_REVIEW_FrontierMath_PRs.md (section P-1) for the reasoning and
# independent_verifier_r1/PROVENANCE.md for the fetch commands and hashes.
#
# Paths here are relative to this directory (problems/MATH-001/experiments/).

# Flammenkamp no-three-in-line data (third-party; redistribution terms not stated upstream)
lit_data/known_solutions_1997.txt
lit_data/dl/
lit_data/out_*
lit_data/readme_text.txt
lit_data/r_*
lit_data/t_*

# Large generated instances (reproducible from the committed generators)
n75_attack/*.cnf
n75_attack/rot2_n75.cnf

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
